<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first proposal. The author’s proper name and work title are source-attested identifiers. mchog is aligned to the honorific Master in this attribution. The title has two strictly tighter d7 members; no sound-to-meaning decomposition of the author’s name is claimed. gis and bound genitive/participial material are omitted: agentive by remains an open campaign issue and is not falsely nulled. “The following selections are” and the dates are supplied attribution apparatus and remain verbatim, unpaired. brtsoms is preserved as the actual source reading; corpus recurrence does not establish an independent publication history.</div>
